<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-dark:#888888;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;--shiki-light:#62687b;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;">    ///</span><span style="--shiki-dark:#BBBBBB;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;--shiki-light:#62687b;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;"> The two sides are equal (value model, type model).</span></span>
